{"id":"vod_sn_39076","vodId":"39076","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"堀与宫村","name_cn":"堀与宫村","date":"2021-01-01","year":"2021","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/8150cb54c4ac9d46205ef7a31dc196c2.jpg"},"summary":"堀京子（户松遥 配音）是长相漂亮，穿戴又十分时尚的潮流女孩，在学校里颇有一番人气。可一回到家，为了照顾年幼的弟弟和方便做家务，京子会换上非常土气的居家服，常年不在家的母亲让京子在不知不觉中扮演了代替者的角色，但这样地味的一面，可千万不能让学校的同学们知道啊！　　一天，一个 耳朵上打满了耳洞的刺青男敲响了京子家的大门，穿着居家服的京子去看们，让她没有想到的是，眼前这个潮男，竟然是平日里在班上被评价为宅男的宫村伊澄（内山昂辉 配音），原来宫村和京子一样，过着隐秘的双重生活。以弟弟为契机，宫村开始频繁的拜访京子家，两人以他们的真面目相对，心与心之间的距离逐渐缩短。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:07:08","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rUfwyvk0WQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/NUec4SpRw31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zAtF4cFyWN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/831MqVLze71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6j003cmPqr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/TjxEYVmi651/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/LES48q1vtx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VxV94iF7tZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/F9GnZ5hhmg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jB2HBZxpBh1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/mrrFHjJMzd1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YS4dwDwC0n1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3inFD8pwqc1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:50.863Z"}